A pipeline step runs `npm run verify` with the `package.json` below. The `lint` script reports an error and exits with a non-zero status. What happens?
```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "lint": "node tools/lint.js",
    "test": "node tools/test.js",
    "verify": "npm run lint && npm run test"
  }
}
```

A repository's `Makefile` contains the rules below, and a developer runs `make bundle`. What is printed?
```make
.PHONY: compile verify bundle
bundle: verify
	@echo packing
verify: compile
	@echo checking
compile:
	@echo compiling
```

A job runs `npm run build` with default npm settings and the `package.json` below. Which TWO other scripts run automatically as part of that command?
```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "prebuild": "node tools/check-env.js",
    "build": "node tools/compile.js",
    "postbuild": "node tools/copy-assets.js",
    "test": "node tools/test.js",
    "lint": "node tools/lint.js"
  }
}
```
